      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "透过反复训练提升实力让她不再倒下。\n我认为这是将美丽传递给全世界所必须做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6721d05e08d395e707d84961ed56d1f53b84aa3a26b6d6cafb65d8cccf70224c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
